This project integrates user-provided local project and skill material.

Reference collector: forumcrawl, supplied by the project owner. Its queue, immutable evidence,
bounded-stop, URL validation and verification design informed the integration.
The copied site_profiles.py is a reference snapshot and is not the runnable
collector. The original continuous controller is deliberately not invoked.

The original vps-review-analyze skill and review.py are copied unchanged and
invoked for their existing 61-field validation and normalization contract.
NodeSeek first-post parsing is adapted from the user-provided
vps-review-download skill and retains its explicit div#0 / article.post-content
scope and permitted linked-report domains.

Source SHA256 identities are recorded in provenance.json. No separate license
file was found in the scoped reference roots. No license grant is invented;
the copies retain their original ownership and restrictions. Confirm rights
before redistributing them publicly. No private runtime data or credentials
are bundled. Source checkout is the supported deployment format.
